# URL used for /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt. Set to your production domain once deployed.
SITE_URL=https://tru-construction-estimator.com

# Endpoint the waitlist API route (app/api/subscribe/route.ts) forwards new
# signups to as POST { "email": "..." }. Point this at your email provider's
# webhook/API (e.g. a Mailchimp or ConvertKit form action URL, or a small
# proxy you control). If left unset, signups are only logged server-side —
# see README.md for details on wiring up a real provider.
EMAIL_ENDPOINT=
